---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About – Lucas Christian" description="Meet Lucas Christian, a Seattle-area Staff Security Engineer at Databricks specializing in enterprise security, SSPM, endpoint security, and automation.">
  <Navigation />
  
  <main class="flex-1">
    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-4">
          About Me
        </h1>
        <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full"></div>
      </header>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg">I’m Lucas Christian, a <strong class="text-gray-200">Staff Security Engineer in Enterprise Security at Databricks</strong>, based in the Greater Seattle Area.</p>
        <p>I have more than 10 years of security experience across Databricks, Uber, Susquehanna International Group (SIG), and consulting. My work spans enterprise endpoint security, SaaS Security Posture Management (SSPM), zero-trust access, and security automation.</p>
        <p>At Databricks, I own enterprise EDR, scale SaaS security monitoring and controls, and build AI-assisted automation for architecture reviews. I also develop security guidance, contribute to roadmaps, and mentor engineers.</p>
        <p>Previously, at Uber, I worked on endpoint protection, data loss prevention, security automation, and secure mergers, acquisitions, and divestitures. At SIG, I built controls for privileged access, Windows security, and infrastructure hardening.</p>
        <p>I hold CISSP and OSCP certifications and earned a Bachelor of Science in Computing Security, with a minor in Criminal Justice, from Rochester Institute of Technology.</p>
        <!-- Skills/Interests -->
        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-800">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-6">Focus Areas</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
              <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm mb-2">Security Platform Engineering</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">EDR, SSPM, endpoint protection at scale</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
              <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm mb-2">Zero-Trust Architecture</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Device posture, SSO enforcement, policy-based access control</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
              <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm mb-2">M&A Security</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Due diligence, secure integrations, compliance architecture</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
              <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm mb-2">Technical Leadership</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Architecture reviews, mentoring, security roadmaps</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-800">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-4">Security beyond the day job</h2>
          <p>My roots are in RIT’s security community, including RC3 and SPARSA. I founded Team Contagion and competed in capture-the-flag and attack/defend events. I’ve also mentored Cyber Patriot students and volunteered on security competition white teams.</p>
          <p><a href="/blog">Explore my security research and CTF write-ups</a>.</p>
        </section>
        <!-- Resume & Contact -->
        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-800">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-6">Get in Touch</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a 
              href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GFiR3HzvKCexj-5M4steNWDCpsjiT_j9/preview"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-500 !text-black visited:!text-black font-mono text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-400/50 no-underline"
            >
              View Resume
            </a>
            <a 
              href="mailto:lucas@lucaschristian.com"
              class="px-6 py-3 bg-gray-800/50 text-gray-100 font-mono text-sm font-medium rounded-lg border border-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:border-emerald-400/50 transition-all text-center"
            >
              lucas@lucaschristian.com
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
